The theoretical maximum Glory would be 72,000 if all waves were completed on the first tick. Taking the fastest possible wave completions into account, the likely limit is somewhere between 60,000 - 65,000.

The minimum amount of Glory that one can theoretically complete the Colosseum with is 16,350.

== Rewards ==
Rewards for increased Glory are unlocked at specific threshold amounts, and come with an associated title. 

The minimal amount of Glory obtained after completing wave 12 is 16,350, meaning that completing wave 12 is not guaranteed to be enough to unlock every reward. Realistically, with more valuable handicaps and reasonable time bonuses, it is more likely that completing wave 7 or 8 would be sufficient to become a Grand Champion.

