==Glory Expert==
[[Gloria]] is an expert on matters of Glory. She resides in the atrium of the Fortis Colosseum, wandering near the [[colosseum scoreboard]], which she personally updates. She provides information on how Glory works, the rewards for increased Glory, and she can check the player's current rank (which is also visible on the scoreboard).

== Trivia ==

* With the exception of 'Challenger', the titles associated with Glory tiers also exist in [https://en.uesp.net/wiki/Oblivion:Arena_(faction)#Matches_and_Advancing The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion's 'Arena' faction], which is focused on gladiatorial activity.
